            "review_title": "Review at Rex Hotel",
            "review_text": "Sylvie769\nBruges, Belgium5 contributions\n0\nGood, decent hotel in the city centre\nOct 2026 • Business\nThis is a very big hotel right in the centre of the city, with very good service. Sometimes it can feel a bit overwhelming because the hotel is so big, but once in the tranquility of your room you can perfectly unwind after a busy day on the streets of this lively city. People at the reception are very kind and helpful. I want to especially mention Mrs Nguyen Thi Boa Binh, the airport representative, who went out of her way to serve us. Very friendly too, always greeting when you pass by. Keep up the good work!\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
