            "review_title": "Review at Rex Hotel",
            "review_text": "Monika E\n9 contributions\n0\nDisappointment\nNov 2025 • Couples\nA disappointment :\n\nFoyer: corresponds to a shopping mall, impersonal for the hotel guest.\n\nRooms: Windows out to the dingy courtyard. \nLamps in the room hung askew as in a comic book ( see photo ).\n\nBathroom: very modern renovated. But the gorgeous manual two lever design mixer tap in the shower was not functional. Either you burned yourself with hot water, or it was cold.\n\nBreakfast; the coffee was the worst I had in 2 weeks in Vietnam. It was watery and tasted of cardamom and cocoa. \nI asked the waitress if she could bring me \"real\" coffee? But she was overwhelmed with it, told me the Vietnamese coffee would not please the foreigners.\nThis is serious in a 5 star hotel? \n\nThe whole place is no longer on the level of 5 stars, I would not recommend it. Renovations urgently needed ( see pictures of the courtyard ).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten January 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
