            "review_title": "Review at Rex Hotel",
            "review_text": "rgoliver6\nSydney, Australia10 contributions\n1\nThe Rex Hotel\nMar 2024 • Family\nWe stayed 2 nights. Checking in was a challenge. Getting late checkout was a challenge, we had to go to 3 different people to come up with a solution and it was expensive to pay for late checkout. \n\nI found the inside a little dated and smelt of cigars from the cigar club. Which was weird because all the shopping on the ground floor is designer labels, but the hotel part was old and dated. The rooftop is such a great spot to enjoy a drink and the view, however its Sydney prices. \nOverall I was disappointed with the service and found that some of the front desk people were not very accommodating.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nIts expensive for HCMC and there are nicer places to eat and drink for the same or a lot less. Save your time and head to somewhere else\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 2, 2024",
